('ic_timeline_reliability_70', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'Timeline Reliability', 'experiential', 70, 'Cross-Functional Milestone Tracker', 'Act as milestone tracker for a cross-functional project for two weeks, synthesizing Friday status updates.', 'What patterns emerged in how peers estimated capacity versus actual output?', 'Project Lead', 'Sprint Cycle', 'Formally announce the employee''s temporary tracking role to the project team to establish authority and ensure compliance.', 'In our next bi-weekly check-in, let''s review your first Friday milestone synthesis together to calibrate tone and cross-functional expectations.', 1),
('ic_timeline_reliability_20', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'Timeline Reliability', 'social', 20, 'Senior PM Playbook Interview', 'Interview a senior project manager to learn their techniques for estimating duration and managing scope creep.', 'Which tactical routine can you implement tomorrow?', 'Mentorship', '1-on-1 Inquiry', 'Formally announce the employee''s temporary tracking role to the project team to establish authority and ensure compliance.', 'In our next bi-weekly check-in, let''s review your first Friday milestone synthesis together to calibrate tone and cross-functional expectations.', 2),
('ic_timeline_reliability_10', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'Timeline Reliability', 'formal', 10, 'Agile Estimation Foundations', 'Complete a foundational module on Agile sprint planning and velocity tracking.', 'Where does your task management deviate most significantly from established Agile principles?', 'Agile Framework', 'Self-Paced Module', 'Formally announce the employee''s temporary tracking role to the project team to establish authority and ensure compliance.', 'In our next bi-weekly check-in, let''s review your first Friday milestone synthesis together to calibrate tone and cross-functional expectations.', 3),
('ic_high_quality_delivery_70', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'High-Quality Delivery', 'experiential', 70, 'Formal Pre-Flight Self-QA Checklist', 'Implement a formal ''self-QA'' checklist before submitting your next three major deliverables.', 'Which recurring error did this checklist catch before it reached the broader team?', 'Quality Assurance', 'Pre-Submission Protocol', 'Allocate an extra 10% buffer time to the employee''s next deadline specifically designated for comprehensive self-review.', 'Which recurring error caught by your self-QA checklist surprised you most, and how can we turn that check into a team-wide standard?', 4),
('ic_high_quality_delivery_20', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'High-Quality Delivery', 'social', 20, 'Mutual High-Detail Peer Review', 'Partner with a peer known for high attention to detail and conduct a mutual review of each other''s work prior to final submission.', 'What specific formatting or structural choice did your peer make that you can adopt? What did you see in their work that you could emulate?', 'Peer Review', 'Partner Exchange', 'Allocate an extra 10% buffer time to the employee''s next deadline specifically designated for comprehensive self-review.', 'Which recurring error caught by your self-QA checklist surprised you most, and how can we turn that check into a team-wide standard?', 5),
('ic_high_quality_delivery_10', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'High-Quality Delivery', 'formal', 10, 'Lean Six Sigma Mistake-Proofing (Poka-Yoke)', 'Read an article or module on Lean Six Sigma principles related to defect reduction in knowledge work.', 'How can you apply the concept of ''poka-yoke'' (mistake-proofing) to your daily routine?', 'Lean Methodology', 'Defect Reduction', 'Allocate an extra 10% buffer time to the employee''s next deadline specifically designated for comprehensive self-review.', 'Which recurring error caught by your self-QA checklist surprised you most, and how can we turn that check into a team-wide standard?', 6),
