('ic_execution_efficiency_20', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'Execution Efficiency', 'social', 20, 'Productivity Champion Shadowing', 'Shadow a highly productive peer for half a day to observe how they manage their inbox, task list, and context-switching.', 'What boundary-setting technique did they use that you often struggle with?', 'Peer Shadowing', 'Workflow Observation', 'Support the employee in declining non-essential meetings and formally approve their proposed asynchronous communication channels.', 'How many reclaimed hours were you able to convert into uninterrupted deep work this week, and how can I help protect those blocks?', 8),
