('ic_practical_solutions_10', 'ic', 'Problem Solving', 'Practical Solutions', 'formal', 10, 'MVP Problem-Solving Case Study', 'Read a case study on using a ''minimum viable product'' (MVP) approach to resolve an operational bottleneck.', 'How can you apply lean prototyping principles to a deliverable right now?', 'Case Study', 'Agile Problem Solving', 'Protect two hours of the employee''s schedule this week strictly dedicated to building and testing their workflow automation.', 'Where else in the department could this template or automation be leveraged once validated?', 21),
('ic_roadblock_diagnosis_70', 'ic', 'Problem Solving', 'Roadblock Diagnosis', 'experiential', 70, 'Visual Workflow Bottleneck Mapping', 'The next time a process stalls, map the exact workflow on a whiteboard or virtual canvas to identify the specific step where the breakdown occurred, before proposing a fix.', 'Did the visual map reveal a different root cause than your initial assumption?', 'Process Mapping', 'Visual Diagnostics', 'During the next 1-on-1, resist giving the employee the answer to a blocker; instead, ask them to visually step through the issue with you.', 'When you stepped through the workflow map, what structural variable surfaced that wasn''t visible in the initial post-mortem?', 22),
